==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|urj-fin-pro|*epä}}. Originally active present participle ({{m|fi|-pä}}) of the negative verb stem ''*e-''; see {{m|fi|ei}}. Cognate with {{cog|et|eba-}}, {{cog|liv|äb}}, {{cog|mdf|аф}}, {{cog|myv|апак}}.

